WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.920
- Let's get to the judicial reform.

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:04.260
Ever since this judicial
reform was proposed back

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:07.320
in January, this country has
been in a state of turmoil.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.750
You paused this legislation
in order to allow

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.030
for talks with the opposition
because you were worried,

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.950
like many people in the
country, each sides fighting

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.410
for each other could
descend into a civil war.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.530
But those talks with the
opposition now have broken down

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:23.430
and you say you may advance
this legislation unilaterally.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.230
Are you not willing to return

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.150
to the talks with the opposition at all?

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.350
Will you just continue now

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:30.420
to unilaterally pass this legislation?

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.600
- Well, I definitely
sought a broad consensus

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.910
and possibly in a formal
agreement with the opposition.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:38.430
But what we discovered after I pushed

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:40.560
the pause button after one month

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.900
and two months and three
months, that the opposition

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.850
was under such political pressures

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:47.460
that they couldn't agree to
the most minimal understanding.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:51.390
They couldn't agree to
things that we brought up

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:54.360
by the opposition leaders before
they went into opposition.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.620
- Can you be more specific, though?

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.900
What would you changed
from the original proposal

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.370
from this measured proposal?

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:00.203
What will be different?

00:01:00.203 --> 00:01:01.860
- Well, I already changed a few things

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:04.920
right after the original
proposal was put forward.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:09.030
I said that the idea of an override clause

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:12.150
where the parliament the Knesset
can override the decisions

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:14.460
of the supreme court
with a simple majority.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:16.860
I said, I threw that out, basically.

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:18.360
- That's not coming back at all?

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:19.380
- You're not following this.

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:21.120
People don't know, they
just don't follow me.

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:22.020
- Well, we thought it might come back

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:22.980
with a super majority.

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:24.930
- No, I said it's out.

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:25.763
- Okay.

00:01:25.763 --> 00:01:29.570
- And it's very clear that
the way of choosing judges,

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:33.540
it's not gonna be the current structure,

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:35.280
but it's not gonna be
the original structure.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:37.710
- Let's talk about Iran's
relationship with Russia.

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:40.080
Iran is now supplying Russia
with drones that it uses

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:42.810
in Ukraine and Russia has
a deal with Iran to supply

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:44.760
it with fighter jets, combat helicopters.

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:47.100
Russia is helping Iran advance
its cyber capabilities,

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:49.590
potentially its missile
production facilities.

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:51.270
How does this new relationship

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:53.850
between Iran and Russia
change the relationship

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:55.410
between Israel and Russia?

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:59.220
- Well, it's a very disturbing
relationship, obviously,

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:04.080
partnership, because it
gives Iran the weapons

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:08.910
or the means to advance its
goals against Israel and others,

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:11.640
against the Arab states
and against many others.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:15.750
And it also, Iran is
supplying Russia with weapons

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:20.280
that are used in the war of
Ukraine with deadly effect.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.780
So obviously, we're concerned with that.

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:24.543
We've made our concerns
known to the Russians.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:28.240
We are also helping
Ukraine, we're helping them

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:33.330
in civilian defense, an
alert civilian alert system

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:36.090
that prevents, that will obviate the need

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:39.930
to get half the country in
shelters for every missile fired.

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:41.970
So we're helping them with that,

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:43.320
but we're making our concerns

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:45.387
to the Russian government.
- What did

00:02:45.387 --> 00:02:46.456
Moscow say back?

00:02:46.456 --> 00:02:47.520
Can you share that with us?

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.560
- Well, I think they're
aware of our concerns

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:54.560
and I think it's important to understand

00:02:55.140 --> 00:03:00.140
that we are concerned also with
the possibility that systems

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:04.303
that we would give to Ukraine would fall

00:03:04.303 --> 00:03:09.303
into Iranian hands and
could be reverse engineered

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:13.680
and we would find ourselves
facing Israeli systems used

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:14.610
against Israel.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.010
And by the way, that's
not a theoretical system,

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:20.010
a theoretical threat
because Western system,

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:24.900
anti-tank systems, for example,
did exactly that journey

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:28.413
and we now find them on
our borders with Hezbollah.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:32.340
Remember, Israel is a country
the size of New Jersey.

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:36.063
It's been pelted with 20,000,
more than 20,000 rockets,

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:41.790
in a very densely populated country.

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:44.190
And we haven't had many
casualties for one reason

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:47.340
because Iron Dome shoots down 95%

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.443
of the missiles that enter our,

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.530
it could hit our populated centers.

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:56.700
Now, if that system were to
fall in the hands of Iran,

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:00.360
then millions of Israelis
would be left defenseless

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.193
and imperiled.

00:04:01.193 --> 00:04:02.700
- Are you aware of what
the Ukrainian ambassador

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:03.990
to Israel said recently

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:07.170
that Israel says its stance is neutral

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:08.850
about this conflict
between Ukraine and Russia.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.430
But he said in reality, it's pro-Russia.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:13.350
He said that Israel
really hadn't delivered

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.510
on its promises regarding aid to Ukraine.

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:16.920
How do you respond to those assertions

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:17.940
by the Ukrainian ambassador?

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:18.960
- Well, that's not true.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:21.300
The former government made some promises

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:23.100
which were in the process.

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:26.160
Well, they weren't delivered,
but I delivered them.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.450
And I think people know,

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:30.720
maybe you should find out what's going on,

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.160
but we're not neutral.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:35.940
We've expressed our sympathy
and our position with Ukraine.

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:39.060
But I'm saying there is a
limit, limitations that we have.

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:41.280
and concerns and interests that we have.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:45.270
And my first interest,
regardless of sympathy

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:48.270
and the steps that we take
is to ensure the security

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:49.920
of the one and only Jewish state.

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:52.980
And we have the concerns that I told you.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:55.980
We are also, our pilots
are flying right next

00:04:55.980 --> 00:05:00.060
to Russian pilots over the skies of Syria

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:02.760
in order to block the attempts of Iran

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:06.600
to establish a second
Hezbollah front in Syria.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.490
- Is there any indication
that the Iranians

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.350
are trying to build a nuclear bomb itself,

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:11.790
a nuclear warhead?

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:15.510
- Well, there is more than indication

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:18.870
because I sent the Mossad
to the heart of Tehran

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:22.440
and they brought back Iran's
secret nuclear archive.

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:26.220
And the opening document
of that archive said

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:30.260
that Iran's purpose 20
years ago, 21 years ago,

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:34.590
in 2003, was to build five kiloton bombs.

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:36.540
That's five Hiroshima bombs.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.770
That's 21 years ago.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.200
So you can assume that they
haven't abandoned this goal.

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.940
- But is there evidence
that they're reviving

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.560
that project today?
- Well, they certainly

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:44.910
have revived that project

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:47.070
in the sense that they're
moving all the time

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:50.130
with enrichment, as you said,
which is a critical component

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:51.240
of making a nuclear bomb.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.710
It's not the only component.

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:55.320
There's also the weaponization group,

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:56.580
there's also the missile group.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.630
- Can you tell us us what's happening

00:05:57.630 --> 00:05:58.860
with the weaponization group?

00:05:58.860 --> 00:05:59.940
- I could, but I won't.

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:02.520
- The US is now re-engaging
diplomatically with Iran,

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:05.250
quote a mini deal around
its nuclear program.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.770
Do you think this so-called
mini deal is the first stage

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:09.900
in reviving the old Iran deal,

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:12.350
or do you think the old
Iran deal is really dead?

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:16.470
- Any deal with Iran that doesn't set back

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:17.760
their nuclear infrastructure,

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:22.760
that doesn't, basically, take
it apart is not very useful.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.620
Khomeini just said, "Well,
I'm willing to enter a deal.

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:28.860
I just will not roll back
any of the infrastructure."

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:31.350
He said that about the mini deal

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:33.420
and he wants to get money,
he's gonna get billions.

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:35.070
So I think that's a bad deal.

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:38.100
Obviously, a deal which would
give them hundreds of billions

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:41.310
of dollars and would enable
them within two years,

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:43.920
three years, in what is
called the sunset clause

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:47.610
to remove all limitations
on the nuclear enrichment

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:48.990
is a far worse deal.

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:53.013
So look, maximum deal or mini deal,

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:58.050
neither is going to stop us
from doing what we need to do

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:00.120
to defend Israel against a regime

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:02.880
that openly says it's out to destroy us,

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:05.460
and is seeking to achieve
the means to do so.

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:09.390
So we will do whatever is
necessary to defend ourselves.

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:11.670
- You've known President Biden
now for over four decades,

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:14.610
you've friendly relationship,
but since the establishment

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:16.080
of your new government,
you haven't received

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.640
an invitation to the White House.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:20.040
Some of your senior
ministers can't get meetings

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:21.780
with the Biden administration as well.

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:24.210
What does that say
about the current nature

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.880
of the relationship between
Israel and the United States?

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:27.713
- Well, you're quite right.

00:07:27.713 --> 00:07:30.150
I've known President
Biden for over 40 years

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:31.830
and it's been a close friendship.

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:34.860
We don't always agree, we often disagree,

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:36.090
but it's instructive to say,

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:40.470
I think he's a self-described
Zionist, pro-Israel,

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:42.690
and I don't think that's
an inaccurate description.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:43.830
I think it's accurate.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:47.010
I think he has a basic
sympathy for the Jewish state,

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:50.880
although as in any family,
we can disagree and often do.

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:53.430
But I have no doubt about his sentiment

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:56.130
and I trust that that will continue.

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.030
And I can also tell you

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:00.630
that in the times of the
Obama administration,

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:03.600
when Mr. Biden was vice president,

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:08.600
he often served as a
channel to try to find,

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.010
I would say, a middle ground,

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.900
during times of intense conflict.

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:17.640
So the friendship is not a question.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:20.040
Now, here's what people don't know.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:23.400
I mean this issue of the
invitation clouds people's views

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:29.310
and actually their knowledge
of what is happening

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:31.650
with our two governments and in fact,

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:35.550
the security cooperation,
the military cooperation,

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:38.520
and the intel cooperation including cyber

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:41.973
is stronger than it's ever
been under our two governments.

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:46.710
I've spoken to the president
a few a few weeks ago

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.130
on the phone since then, I
may not go to Washington,

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:53.490
but Washington is coming
here with a steady flow

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:56.760
including the National
Security Advisor, Jake Sullivan

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:00.360
and Secretary Blinken,
and the chief of the CIA,

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:02.400
all of whom I've met, of course.

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.620
And the phone calls that are regular.

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:07.740
- The last 15 months have
been the most violent period

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:10.260
in the West Bank in over two decades.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:11.610
The reason that according
to Israeli officials

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.640
is because the Palestinian
authority has lost control

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:15.473
over some areas.

00:09:15.473 --> 00:09:17.010
What is your solution for this?

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:19.260
Is it, as some people say, some people

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:20.400
in your government say

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:23.010
to put more Israeli security
services in those areas?

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:25.860
Or is it to strengthen the
Palestinian authority there?

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:29.190
- It's both, but they failed,
the second has failed.

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:30.023
I mean, they failed.

00:09:30.023 --> 00:09:33.690
They're stuck in their
own convoluted politics

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:36.330
which is undergoing some convulsion.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:38.250
But I think you're quite right.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:41.430
I mean, Northern Samaria has
become sort of a no man's land

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:43.800
at which you've more
and more terror attacks

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:45.570
that emanate from there.

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:47.283
And my policy has been to,

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:51.030
definitely to keep the
Palestinian authority.

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:53.370
I don't want it to dissolve
the way people are talking,

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:54.603
it's simply ridiculous.

